                         "cameraFocusGuid":  "",
                         "cameraDistance":  "Far",
                         "cameraHeight":  "Default",
                         "revealRadius":  -1
                     },
                     {
                         "words":  "Well, that would be the turrets... there is a full strength Capellan artillery battery in place, which includes twelve guns and you can be absolutely certain that those guns will be turned on you.",
                         "wordsColor":  {
                                            "r":  1,
                                            "g":  1,
