                         "audioName":  "NONE",
                         "cameraFocusGuid":  "",
                         "cameraDistance":  "Far",
                         "cameraHeight":  "Default",
                         "revealRadius":  -1
                     },
                     {
                         "words":  "To capture the Firebase, you\u0027ll need to deal with a reinforced Warrior House LuSaan Company. With Captain Holzmann\u0027s delay, I am now planning for the Captain to break into the Firebase with you when you kick in the front door. After that, we can turn these gun positions on the defenders of the Forbidden City. The garrison has seen you coming and they are advancing to block the pass you are moving through. Good luck",
